  "details": "VRChat SDK Base, Worlds 3.7.6\n\nThis can be confirmed on the LeaderBoard in Example Central.\n\n1. Open the LeaderBoard Scene in Example Central without editing it, and run Build & Test with three or more Clients.\n\n2. Jump and check. The client data of the instance master will not be synced to other players.\n\nThis case may not occur. When I checked, it was successfully synced about once in ten times.\n\nI also made a leaderboard that used user data with a minimal, but similarly the client data of the instance master did not sync.\n\n(I noticed this case when I wanted to create a simple leaderboard, focusing on the User data feature that allows you to get other players' data.)",
